infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title What a guard can answer vs what needs the record
  desc req.user + route metadata before the handler, or fetch the row first
  compares
    - label Answerable in a guard
      children
        - label Are you authenticated?
          desc JwtAuthGuard attaches req.user with no query
        - label Do you hold the role?
          desc @Roles() plus Reflector.getAllAndOverride vs user.roles
        - label May this role act on this type?
          desc PoliciesGuard evaluates ability.can(action, Type)
    - label Needs the loaded record
      children
        - label Do you own THIS post?
          desc Load it, then compare post.ownerId to user.id
        - label Only your own draft?
          desc True for one row, false for the next, never a role
        - label ABAC still needs the instance
          desc can(Update, Article) must judge a real Article, not the type
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
